        "precision": "exact"
      },
      "claim_text": "The LLM gives the same opening date for all three relevant articles, better than the two human coders who agree on two of three.",
      "assessment": "partially",
      "cannot_verify_reason": null,
      "evidence_summary": "The date comparison covers only three articles. In the third, the path opened before the school year and the official opening was held later; the pilot coder chose the official opening and the second coder the school-year start. Matching the pilot coder on this item is not evidence of resolving the ambiguity. The abstract and introduction report the date result without the n=3 qualification. No date-accuracy or date-precision validation exists beyond these three articles, although the paper's headline output includes counts of projects dated to the day or month.",
