      "numeric_check": null,
      "suggested_fix": "Disclose whether the validation articles or labels informed the prompt revision, report first-prompt versus final-prompt agreement on the validation set, and label the pilot as development-set evidence rather than a held-out test."
    },
    {
      "id": "ROB-004",
      "category": "specification_sensitivity",
      "finding_summary": "The validation agreement (Table 4) is computed on the majority of three LLM runs, but the paper does not state whether the 3,187-article run also used three runs with majority vote or a single API call per article, so the validated specification may differ from the deployed one.",
