      "cannot_verify_reason": null,
      "evidence_summary": "The pilot covers 2 September–10 October 2026 and the full run October 2025–October 2026 across 236 outlets, so period, outlets and article mix differ. No full-run precision or recall estimate is reported; project grouping and date precision in the full run are unvalidated. Section 8 acknowledges that a random sample of the full run should be checked against human coding, but the abstract and conclusion report the counts and the conclusion says the study 'demonstrated the potential' without qualifying the unvalidated scale-up. Pilot recall is also uninformative because only 3 relevant articles exist.",
