      "evidence_summary": "The comparison is a descriptive subgroup contrast. The paper hedges with 'suggests' and proposes an ordered model (1) with project controls as a next step, but the sentence reads as a finding about dependence on attention. Large projects may attract ceremonies and also have precise dates; ceremony articles may directly state a date. Neither alternative is examined. The 18 + 26 = 44 split is consistent with the project total. The later decision rule (use only precisely dated projects) rests on this unverified pattern.",
